    &= a_t^{-d} \varphi \left( (a_t^2 + b_t^2)^{-\frac12} x \right) \left(\frac{a_t}{\sqrt{a_t^2 + b_t^2}}\right)^d \int_{{\mathbb{R}}^d} f \left( \frac{b_t}{a_t^2 + b_t^2} x + \frac{a_t}{\sqrt{a_t^2 + b_t^2}} z \right) \mathrm{d} \gamma_d(z) \\
